    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module" kindref="compound">Module</ref> pass, wrapping the inliner pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This works in conjunction with the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_inline_advisor_analysis" kindref="compound">InlineAdvisorAnalysis</ref> to facilitate inlining decisions taking into account module-wide state, that need to keep track of inter-inliner pass runs, for a given module. An <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_inline_advisor" kindref="compound">InlineAdvisor</ref> is configured and kept alive for the duration of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module_inliner_wrapper_pass_1a302bbe2963bced6cb8460b94f89dd0be" kindref="member">ModuleInlinerWrapperPass::run</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
